   "notes": [
    "Dative and locative singular: -ovi is the usual ending for people (Petrovi, panu Novákovi). When two words stand together, only the last takes -ovi: panu Petrovi.",
    "Vocative: stems ending in -r change it to -ře (Petr → Petře), and stems in -k, -h, -ch take -u (Marek → Marku, kluk → kluku).",
    "Accusative singular = genitive singular for all masculine animate nouns: Vidím pána. Mám psa."
   ],
   "nativeReviewed": false
  },
